From 2698dda014fcbaf1324544aafb0ade1c37dabccc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rosetta <cole@phosphor.co>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 18:54:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat(facets): add extensible thread facets revision 1
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Model facets as namespaced Thread–Member relations with explicit one-or-many cardinality and authoritative completeness.

- Add generation-safe plugin capabilities, stable public query and cursor contracts, CLI access, and additive 0108 persistence.

- Project Thread Progress and exact PrincipalKey participant groups into saved web and mobile My progress views without copying legacy membership.

- Preserve identity, authored messaging, deployment guidance, and active-sidebar scope through public regression witnesses.
